            "detailed_description": "Colourise is a puzzle game about connecting the dots. It's easier said than done.<br><br>Rack your brain to solve complex spatial puzzles in an astronomy-inspired, abstract, neon world. Mix vibrant, neon colours together; shift dynamic parts of the environment, opening up new pathways to solve seemingly impossible puzzles; and move yourself to see the world from a whole new perspective. What seems impossible to begin with might be clearer than you think.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>24 regular puzzles, with regularly introduced, interesting new mechanics.<br></li><li>Special levels, with fiendishly difficult puzzles that will have you stumped for hours.<br></li><li>Steam Achievements and Trading Cards to complete and collect.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Colourise is a puzzle game about connecting the dots. It's easier said than done.<br><br>Rack your brain to solve complex spatial puzzles in an astronomy-inspired, abstract, neon world. Mix vibrant, neon colours together; shift dynamic parts of the environment, opening up new pathways to solve seemingly impossible puzzles; and move yourself to see the world from a whole new perspective. What seems impossible to begin with might be clearer than you think.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>24 regular puzzles, with regularly introduced, interesting new mechanics.<br></li><li>Special levels, with fiendishly difficult puzzles that will have you stumped for hours.<br></li><li>Steam Achievements and Trading Cards to complete and collect.</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Colourise is a puzzle game about connecting the dots. It's easier said than done. Explore over twenty-five complex spatial puzzles in an astronomy-inspired, abstract, neon world.",
